model_input = [\{\
    "prompt": prompt,\
    "multi_modal_data": \{"image": image\}\
\}]\
\
sampling_params = SamplingParams(temperature=0.0, max_tokens=8192)\
outputs = llm.generate(model_input, sampling_params)\
markdown_text = outputs[0].outputs[0].text\
print(markdown_text)\
```\
